 IsolateLink←{
     txt←⍵
     mask←⍺
     0=+/b←']('⍷mask\mask/txt:⍬
     link←⌽(b⍳1)↑txt
     mask2←⌽(≢link)↑mask
     link2←mask2\mask2/link
     r←(≢link)-1++/∧\~(+\link2='[')=+\link2=']'
     r≥0:r
     (mask∧(⍳≢mask)≠b⍳1)∇ txt                 ⍝ No matching "[": not a link, so look for the next one
 }
